        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://worldinparis.com/8th-arrondissement-of-paris",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Élysée Palace, the French president’s official residence, sits in the 8th arrondissement’s right‑bank district.",
